OL,3,GNEWSACCTV to combat abuse of workers at
OL,4,Aroad scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FCCTV cameras are being installed to
OL,7,Fprotect workers who have been abused
OL,8,Fwhile completing a #2.39m road project.
OL,10,FEssex Highways said it was "completely
OL,11,Funacceptable" that its contractors were
OL,12,Fbeing targeted by frustrated motorists
OL,13,Fin Dovercourt.
OL,15,FDrivers have faced a one-way traffic
OL,16,Fsystem in Kingsway since work to repave
OL,17,Fthe road, home to a Wetherspoon pub and
OL,18,Fa library, began in June.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
