OL,3,GNEWSACCTV to combat abuse of workers at
OL,4,Aroad scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are taking this matter very
OL,7,Fseriously and will be installing CCTV
OL,8,Fon-site," Essex Highways said in a
OL,9,Fstatement.
